# Text files are LF in the repository AND in every working tree, on every OS.
# Godot writes project.godot, *.import, *.tscn, *.tres etc. with LF on all platforms. Without
# this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checked them out as CRLF and every file the
# editor rewrote on open showed as modified, although only the line endings changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Visual Studio and `dotnet sln` write solutions with CRLF; keep them that way.
*.sln text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never convert, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
